			"notes": "# Version 1.3.0\n\n## New Features\n\n+ Item Customization (`/sb21 customize`)\n\t- Can have bugs, please report them in the discord server\n+ Infinity Chat History\n+ Crash report logger \n\t- Automatically sends crash reports caused by Skyblock21 to developers\n\t- Helps make Skyblock21 more stable for everyone\n\t- **No personal information is collected or shared**\n\t\n+ `/sb21` command alias for `/skyblock21`\n+ `/skyblock21 update` to update the mod\n\t\n# Changes\n\n- Reworked Auto Updater\n- Various under-the-hood improvements \n\t\n## Fixes\n\n- Fixed rare crash that could occur with the cookie reminder feature\n\n# Report bugs or suggest features\n\nSkyblock21 is still in beta, so if you find a bug or want a new feature added to the mod please submit in our [Discord Server](discord.gg/NMNSwQH6dr) or [Open an issue](https://github.com/sme6en/Skyblock21/issues)."
